Bundled data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/app/data/places/
    Place names, coordinates, populations and time zones from GeoNames
    (https://www.geonames.org/), licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
    International licence (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
    Changes: limited to the cities500 export (populated places with 500 or more
    inhabitants) without sections of populated places (city districts), reduced to the
    columns this program needs, and region and country codes replaced by their names. The download date is in version.txt.
